C - which axis carries intensity in the clean volume

axis 0: peak 32767..32767 (range 0)   voxels 344..2342 (range 1999)
axis 1: peak 32767..32767 (range 0)   voxels 406..2266 (range 1860)
axis 2: peak 6553..58982 (range 52429)   voxels 1222..1222 (range 0)
