D - fp goes negative when one label fills the section crop

output = one label on the object:      f1 1.0000  iou 1.0000
output = that label filling the crop:  f1 0.0000  iou 0.3554
fp = len(unique[unique != tp_label]) - 1 assumes label 0 is present in the crop

